@Gateway.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175
@LocationKey = dev-local-location-key
@DeviceToken = replace-after-enroll

### Health (auth + DB + POS ping — 503 until LocalSecrets:pilot-api-key is set)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Menu (hits Pilot — needs a real API key in user secrets)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Inject a pickup order
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_ref": "OH-LOCAL-001",
  "display_id": "A1",
  "source_channel": "test",
  "location_id": "local-dev",
  "fulfillment_type": "pickup",
  "placed_at": "2026-08-20T12:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "external_product_id": "dev-plu-1",
      "name": "Test burger",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price_cents": 8500,
      "total_price_cents": 8500,
      "modifiers": []
    }
  ],
  "subtotal_cents": 8500,
  "tax_cents": 0,
  "delivery_fee_cents": 0,
  "tip_cents": 0,
  "total_cents": 8500,
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "payment": {
    "prepaid": true
  }
}

### Channel — recent orders for this location key (Harmony stand-in poll)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Channel — one order's status ladder
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/orders/OH-LOCAL-001
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Device — enroll with a 6-digit pairing code issued from the portal (shown once).
### Replace the code; do not commit a real device token.
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/device/enroll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentCode": "000000",
  "deviceName": "Pass kitchen",
  "hardwareFingerprint": "dev-host"
}

### Device — heartbeat (replace DeviceToken after enroll)
# @name deviceHeartbeat
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/device/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{DeviceToken}}

### Device — session
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/device/me
Authorization: Bearer {{DeviceToken}}

### Device — open orders for this store
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/device/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{DeviceToken}}

### Device — mark ready (walks Accepted → Preparing → Ready)
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/device/orders/OH-LOCAL-001/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{DeviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "ready"
}

